  </DocRow>

  <DocRow class="dr-section">
    <h2 id="mirror-search">Mirror a search into your own tool</h2>
    <p>
      Message search takes <code>semantic</code> and <code>exact</code> toggles and
      filters by stream, type, author, and date window. Drop it behind a slash
      command, an editor extension, or a dashboard.
    </p>
    <Fragment slot="code">
